{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnumeration","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnumeration","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.IdentityIContentDecomposition"],"declarations":17,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.rsk_sumSq_eq_factorial_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.rsk_sumSq_eq_factorial_6","kind":"theorem","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L142-L144","doc":"**RSK sum-of-squares at `n = 6` (sorry-free).** `Σ_{λ ⊢ 6} (#SYT λ)² = 6!`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.rsk_sumSq_eq_factorial_5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.rsk_sumSq_eq_factorial_5","kind":"theorem","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L136-L139","doc":"**RSK sum-of-squares at `n = 5` (sorry-free).** `Σ_{λ ⊢ 5} (#SYT λ)² = 5!`, on the\nindependently-enumerated standard-tableau count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_6","kind":"theorem","line":131,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L131-L134","doc":"**Per-shape hook-length validation at `n = 6` (sorry-free).** `#SYT(λ) = dimHLF(λ)` for every\nshape of `6`.  Needs `maxRecDepth` raised for the `720`-deep structural permutation recursion. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_5","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L125-L128","doc":"**Per-shape hook-length validation at `n = 5` (sorry-free).** `#SYT(λ) = dimHLF(λ)` for every\nshape of `5`, extending `numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_le4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.shapes6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.shapes6","kind":"def","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L120-L123","doc":"The partitions of `6` (every weakly-decreasing shape with `∑ = 6`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.shapes5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.shapes5","kind":"def","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L116-L118","doc":"The partitions of `5` (every weakly-decreasing shape with `∑ = 5`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.rsk_sumSq_eq_factorial_le4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.rsk_sumSq_eq_factorial_le4","kind":"theorem","line":94,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L94-L106","doc":"**Identity I axiom (i), validated against genuine standard-tableau counts (sorry-free).**  For\nevery `n ≤ 4`, the RSK / Burnside sum of squares of the *brute-force* `#SYT(λ)` counts equals `n!`:\n\n    Σ_{λ ⊢ n} (numSYTenum λ)² = n!.\n\n`dim_validated_le12` proves the same sum-of-squares for the *hook* dimension `dimHLF`; this proves it\nfor the **independently-enumerated** standard-tableau count — so the RSK identity holds at the level\nof actual tableaux, not merely of the hook closed form.  Together with `numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_le4`\n(per-shape `numSYTenum = dimHLF`), this re-grounds `dim_validated_le12` itself in genuine `#SYT` for\n`n ≤ 4`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_le4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum_eq_dimHLF_le4","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L87-L92","doc":"**Per-shape validation of the hook-length formula (sorry-free).** For every shape with\n`∑ ≤ 4`, the brute-force standard-tableau count equals the Frame–Robinson–Thrall hook dimension:\n`#SYT(λ) = dimHLF(λ)`.  An independent per-shape check that `dim_validated_le12` (sum only) does not\nprovide. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.partitionsByN","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.partitionsByN","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L80-L85","doc":"The partitions of `n`, grouped by `n`, for `n = 1,…,4` (paired with `n` for the `n!` check). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.shapesLE4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.shapesLE4","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L75-L78","doc":"The partitions with `n = ∑ ≤ 4` (every shape; weakly-decreasing row lengths). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.numSYTenum","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L70-L73","doc":"**Brute-force `#SYT(λ)`**: the number of permutations of `[1,…,∑l]` that are standard fillings\nof shape `l`.  Computable (bijectivity is built in by ranging over permutations). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.allPerms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.allPerms","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L64-L68","doc":"All permutations of `l`, by structural recursion (kernel-reducible, unlike `List.permutations`,\nwhich is well-founded and stalls `decide`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.insertEverywhere","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.insertEverywhere","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L59-L62","doc":"All ways to insert `x` into `l` (at each of the `|l|+1` gaps).  Structural recursion on `l`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.isStdFilling","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.isStdFilling","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L53-L57","doc":"A flat filling `a` (a permutation of `[1,…,n]` in row-major order) is a standard tableau of\nshape `l`: reshape and check strict rows and strict columns. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.colsOK","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.colsOK","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L46-L51","doc":"Are adjacent rows strictly increasing column-wise (`rᵢ[j] < rᵢ₊₁[j]` for every `j` of the\nshorter, lower row)?  `(r₂.zip r₁)` pairs `(r₂[j], r₁[j])`; require `r₁[j] < r₂[j]`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.strictInc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.strictInc","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L40-L44","doc":"Is a list strictly increasing? ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.chunk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEnum.chunk","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEnumeration.lean#L35-L38","doc":"Reshape a flat list `a` into rows of lengths given by `l` (row-major). ","signatureChunk":0}]}